      "text": "[7:03PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular mobility around the Badagry Roundabout is presently exhibiting satisfactory fluidity. \nThe thoroughfares from Badagry Roundabout through Toriko Junction, Aradagun, Mowo, Oko Afo, enroute to Ibiye, and down to Ajibade, are demonstrating encouraging traffic flow patterns in both inward and outward directions, with the exception of minor delays at major bus stops.\n\nConversely, the route from Ajibade through Morogbo Junction down to the Agbara Custom Check Point is currently characterized by smooth traffic progression. \nMovement from Agbara Custom Check Point through Agbara Estate Gate down to Ajibade is experiencing moderate congestion, attributable to a significant influx of vehicular traffic moving inward towards Badagry.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
