      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1970554617604821401",
      "text": "[7:15PM] #Vi #TrafficUpdate \n\nVi is currently experiencing a pronounced level of vehicular congestion, precipitated by a substantial backlog of traffic emanating from the Chisco axis. \nThis has culminated in a traffic gridlock within our designated axis, encompassing key locations such as Akin Adeshola, Law School, Ozumba Way, Adeola Odeku, Adetokunbo Ademola, Ahmadu Bello Way, and extending to Eko Hotel through Oniru, with the stretch leading to Marwa Road inward being particularly congested at this time. \nOur officers are actively on ground to manage the situation and mitigate any potential disruptions.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
