      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1970568953509638463",
      "text": "[8:14PM] #LekkiAjah #TrafficUpdate \n\nThe traffic dynamics on the Lekki-Epe Expressway are presently characterized by notable congestion on the stretch from Lekki inward to Maruwa, with the segments from Maruwa to Ikate, Elegushi, and Chisco experiencing heightened traffic volumes, attributable to the recent flash flood in the Elegushi and Chisco areas, extending inward Ileshan. \nConversely, traffic from Ilasan inward Jakande Roundabout, Igbo-Efon, and Chevron Second Tollgate is flowing relatively smoothly, albeit with minor delays observed at the Second Tollgate inward Eleganza, MegaChicken, Ikota, and Ilaje, which connects to Jubilee Bridge. Fortunately, the return journey is currently tranquil.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
