    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1970574316279402862",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1970574316279402862",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1970574316279402862",
      "text": "[8:37PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement within Lekki Peninsula Scheme 1 exhibit a generally fluid movement from the scheme's entrance gate to Farm City, Road 12, and the Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge Roundabout, with traffic flowing smoothly in both directions. \nThe stretch from the Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge Roundabout to Alexander Avenue is presently uncongested in one direction, the return journey is experiencing moderate congestion, likely attributable to the speed breaker, although traffic is progressing at a satisfactory pace.\nMovement from Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge Roundabout to Road 13 and Road 14, extending to Tantalizer and Zenith on Admiralty Way, are currently experiencing heightened traffic volumes, while outward-bound traffic is moving efficiently. \nOn Freedom Way, traffic from Dome and Car Wash is flowing smoothly, whereas VFS down to Ikate is slightly congested at present, although outward-bound traffic remains unimpeded.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
